.SS "\fBAnimated\fP changeCenterOffsetBy (number x, number y, number durationSeconds, int easing = \fR\fBeaseInOutQuad\fP\fP)"

.PP
Animate the rotation-center offset by a delta\&. 
.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
Parameter \fReasing:\fP \fBEasingFunction\fP\&.
.RE
.PP
